      "source": [
        "## Story 1: Data Ingestion & Clean-Up\n",
        "\n",
        "**Goal:** a dataset where every row is a real snack with trustworthy sugar and protein values —\n",
        "because those two fields carry the entire recommendation.\n",
        "\n",
        "### The decision that shaped this analysis: geographic scope\n",
        "\n",
        "41% of snack rows have no sugar or protein value. Rather than dropping them blind, I tested\n",
        "whether the missingness was random. It was not:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "258da574",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "258da574"
      },
      "outputs": [],
